   compute_vars.py — no hand prose numbers), consistent with
   cite_refined_coverage_pct definitions.
2. Regenerate on v2; rewrite the paragraph including the direction of the
   gradient and its cause (reference-layer coverage, not field size).
3. Remove the TODO comment.

